          "author": "Kristo",
          "description": "Ever wondered what secrets the forest whispers when the seasons change? This audio card is your key to Evergreen Hollow, a magical valley where a brand new story begins every single day! \n\nEach morning brings a new 3-minute chapter, part of a delightful week-long tale. Join Finley the Fox and his charming friends as they explore their enchanting home, solve gentle mysteries, and share adventures filled with friendship and kindness.\n\nThe magic of the Hollow is that it lives and breathes with your world! The stories dynamically sync to your local season, reflecting the wonder of spring, the warmth of summer, the crunch of autumn, or the sparkle of winter right outside your window. The tales even know which hemisphere you're in, so the seasons always feel just right!\n\nAnd don't worry if you miss a day! You can always travel back and listen to any chapter from the past seven days to catch up on the fun.\n\nReady for a daily dose of wonder? A new adventure in Evergreen Hollow is waiting for you!",
          "cover": {
            "imageL": "https://card-content.yotoplay.com/13w1jqwg5bxuewrkUcpSGLx1pO9RmzyZnkYHNVbmL1_0~/pub/VQEfE3BKwaRkx1fmf5NOa2LpuiwGgpWO1BKKIhRwRZk"
